OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBrighter
OL,6,Ffurther north initially. However cloud
OL,7,Fwill soon spread in from the south and
OL,8,Fwest to leave a rather cloudy night
OL,9,Fahead with some light showers
OL,10,Fpossible. Another rather mild night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FLargely cloudy skies on Monday
OL,13,Fwith a few outbreaks of rain or
OL,14,Fdrizzle possible at times. Some warm
OL,15,Fand humid brighter spells also likely
OL,16,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
